<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 29.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London May 111.00 Jun 112.00</p>
<p>Northampton Spot 111.00 May 113.00</p>
<p>Liverpool May 116.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolf/Suffolk May 95.00/95.50/96.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jun 97.00</p>
<p>Avon range May 96.00</p>
<p>Devon Jul 100.00</p>
<p>East Anglia asa 93.00</p>
</text>
